24785_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2rkSNP9x00Q7kNvwHR21y4&_nc_oc=AdmcMGhXgC7eRMLugAY68WQqkm1WsmFGdQjzIetqi6ymBJNX7Yio99abaRPJ8GtHt6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv-2_uekvPECfk16zxI9wCRUlRyvmR_ae9v7-6dHmFHcw&oe=69A1AB9A"}, "display_name": "Ninja's Last Stand", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Step into a fully immersive VR world where every slash of your katana and every shot from your gun feels real. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of presence and engagement.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "WHR26 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "6443548731067